<title>USA: Quintiles says completes BRI acquisition.</title>
<headline>Quintiles says completes BRI acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>RESEARCH TRIANGLE PARK, N.C. 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quintiles Transnational Corp said on Friday it had completed its acquisition of BRI International Inc, an Arlington, Va.-based international contract research organization.</p>
<p>Quintiles said that, as previously announced, the deal could add up to $0.05 to the company's earnings per share in 1997. Also as previously announced, Quintiles said it expects to take a related one-time charge of about $4.8 million in the fourth quarter.</p>
</text>
